  "question": {
    "text": "Electric field in a certain region is given by $\\vec{E}=\\left(\\frac{A}{x^2} \\hat{i}+\\frac{B}{y^3} \\hat{j}\\right)$. The SI unit of $A$ and $B$ are:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "srRqP",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{Nm}^3 \\mathrm{C}^{-1} ; \\mathrm{Nm}^2 \\mathrm{C}^{-1}$",
