  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Electric field in a certain region is given by,<br />$\\vec{E}=\\frac{A}{x^2} \\hat{i}+\\frac{B}{y^3} \\hat{j}$<br />$\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{A}}{\\mathrm{x}^2}\\right]=\\mathrm{NC}^{-1} \\Rightarrow[\\mathrm{A}]=\\mathrm{Nm}^2 \\mathrm{C}^{-1}$<br />$\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{B}}{\\mathrm{y}^3}\\right]=\\mathrm{NC}^{-1} \\Rightarrow[\\mathrm{B}]=\\mathrm{Nm}^3 \\mathrm{C}^{-1}$",
    "image": null
  },
